   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "On the previous cell we compared elements in the list of top tokens vs the list of top lemmas to see how many of the lemmas we could find in the token list. Considering the cases like **year** and **years** that ended up being the same lemma in the latter list, more than 85% of tokens were also part of the lemma list.\n",
