   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 3\n",
    "### Analyze common word distributions over different years"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6c71379a-f3d1-4b1e-aab7-99b3cf49e511",
