    "From our plots we can first observe that the most common word for 2017 was mentioned a little bit over half of the times compared to how much its 2023 counterpart was mentioned. For both years both top 20s contain a lot of monosilabic words, and for 2023 even a symbol (talking about money) is included into the top 20.\n",
